<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios-Sept 20.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios-Sept 20.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
